    <detaileddescription>
<para>One viseme event from a <computeroutput>TtsVisemeFrame</computeroutput>. Timing is turn-absolute at the TTS stream&apos;s sample rate. Duration is implied by the next event&apos;s offset (or the sentence end). <computeroutput>weight</computeroutput> (0..1) is how far the shape opens, from the loudness of that stretch of speech; closures and rests are always 1.0. </para>
